  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_fathom_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>fathom, the length covered by the outstreched arms (6 ft.); of wood: a 6 ft. by 6 ft. stack; but used here as a measure of furs (OED s.v. fathom 3b)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
